rfc6070.txt
    Extracted by a script from section 2 of RFC 6070, "PKCS #5: Password-Based Key Derivation Function 2
    (PBKDF2) Test Vectors", https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6070.txt, downloaded on 2026-10-24.
    License: IETF Trust Legal Provisions; the vectors are data.
    Format: Key = Value records: P and S (the ASCII strings in hexadecimal), c and DK (PBKDF2 with HMAC-SHA1).
    Used: every record; the one with c = 16777216 only when the tests are run with --ignored.

